  "qualification": "SC16kernel progress only. Current live/captured/connected/cycle consumers explicitly retain package-wide slicing until SC9 versioned capture cutover; no complete Source, saved13, actual CP-SAT, original15history or all13fact certificate. Solver request/baseline agreement is not Python execution.",
  "changes": [
    "Required SliceStepOrder selects complete own inventories or explicit uniform interpretation; no missing-list fallback.",
    "Own order, empty boundary, policy/duplicate/estimate membership checks retain resource arithmetic.",
    "Descendant selectors expand only matching leaves and name exact no-match context; node/whole rules and cycles remain.",
    "Held reduction filters original matching leaves, preserves authored input, rejects original no-match and absent owner/slice evidence.",
    "Scheduler contract20,15request fixture headers,12Fast cases and7quantum cases; original11Fast/all7quantum values unchanged.",
    "Cache fixture uses actual empty-catalogue migration custody and current-schema minimum FK rows; contracts18/19 excluded before decoding, same-contract corruption retained."
  ],
